ue,"id":110,"name":"Triangle Staff"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"1887, at a remote, elite boarding school in France: Serge Battour returns after his graduation, and remembers the days of his youth...\n\n1880, at the same school: Son of a viscount and a Roma prostitute (both deceased), Serge is intelligent, sweet, talented, and alienated by his family due to his heritage. Upon being sent to his new school, he rooms with Gilbert Cocteau, a gorgeous loner of a boy who sells his body for reasons unknown. Serge's attempts to reach out to Gilbert fail spectacularly, and yet there is something in both of them that attracts them to each other."},"tags":[{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Religion","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fellatio","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boarding School","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Poem of Wind and Trees","english":"The Poem of Wind and Trees","native":"風と木の詩　ＳＡＮＣＴＵＳ－聖なるかな－","romaji":"Kaze to Ki no Uta SANCTUS: Sei Naru Kana","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"風と木の詩 SANCTUS -聖なるかな-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"风与木之诗"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}